==================================================================================================
LANGKAH BERIKUTNYA
==================================================================================================
1. Jalankan migrasi `php artisan migrate` saat deploy ke VPS.
2. Jalankan unit/feature tests di environment container PHP 8.4 (`docker run ... php artisan test`).
3. Deploy update ke VPS mengikuti DEPLOYMENT.prd.
4. Tim Back-Office UG dapat langsung mengintegrasikan `reference-laravel-client`.
